ingle move it had already named (the stored `inspect` function, same as current-position-liberties.js), or replayed the recorded moves to check captures and occupancy and to build the SGF. It never looped over candidate points, scored moves, or played out continuations, so the code only analyzed the current position and kept records.", "stop": false}}